{"name":"Bresaola","hex":"#a9203e","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bresaola","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Air-dried salt-cured beef fillet that has been aged about 2-3 months until it becomes very hard and a dark red, almost purple colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bresaola"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bresaola","blocks":[{"text":"Bresaola is air-dried, salted beef that has been aged two or three months until it becomes hard and turns a dark red, almost purple colour. It is made from top (inside) round, and it is lean and tender, with a sweet, musty smell. It originated in Valtellina, a valley in the Alps of northern Italy's Lombardy region."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/Brisaula.jpg/330px-Brisaula.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bresaola","wikidata":"Q910095"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Exterior spherical lantern on a matte red painted brick facade in Seoul","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Exterior_spherical_lantern_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_in_Seoul.jpg/500px-Exterior_spherical_lantern_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_in_Seoul.jpg","ratio":0.7500456121145777,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Exterior_spherical_lantern_on_a_matte_red_painted_brick_facade_in_Seoul.jpg","share":0.273125},{"title":"Soft Red Rose","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Soft_Red_Rose.jpg/500px-Soft_Red_Rose.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Soft_Red_Rose.jpg","share":0.245625},{"title":"Veiled in Red","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Veiled_in_Red.jpg/500px-Veiled_in_Red.jpg","ratio":0.6772247360482655,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Veiled_in_Red.jpg","share":0.235625},{"title":"Two blue water meters on a matte 